WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Don't think of a white bear.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.000
A simple command can make the bear hard to forget.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.500
In 1987, researchers watched what happened when people tried.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:26.000
Some thoughts returned after suppression.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:33.000
But a 2020 review found immediate effects especially under cognitive load.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:40.000
That is a laboratory finding, not product proof. Notice. Return.